    description: "PlazaFlow Cohort 6: Signal-Desktop and session-desktop have Electron process boundaries (.main.ts/.preload.ts/.dom.ts suffixes) that are invisible. ipcMain.handle/ipcRenderer.invoke pairs are unlinked (only 8 of hundreds detected). Needs: (1) detect ipcMain.on/handle registrations, (2) detect ipcRenderer.send/invoke calls, (3) create ipc_calls edges matching on channel name, (4) optionally detect process boundary from file naming conventions."  # 2770
